<title>USA: Ameron International Corp Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Ameron International Corp Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PASADENA, Calif. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ameron International Corporation</p>
<p>			Third Quarter Ended August 31,</p>
<p>		 (in thousands except share and per share data)</p>
<p>							 1996	    1995</p>
<p> Sales					    $133,622     $137,421</p>
<p> Cost of Sales				    97,402	103,990</p>
<p> Gross Profit				     36,220	 33,431</p>
<p> Operating Profit				  9,946	  7,767</p>
<p> Net Income					  5,972	  4,577</p>
<p>Per Share:</p>
<p>   Net Income					 1.50	   1.16</p>
<p>			 Nine Months Ended August 31,</p>
<p>		 (in thousands except share and per share data)</p>
<p>							 1996	    1995</p>
<p> Sales					    $366,006     $353,978</p>
<p> Cost of Sales				   273,571	267,379</p>
<p> Gross Profit				     92,435	 86,599</p>
<p> Operating Profit				 18,712	 15,426</p>
<p> Net Income					 10,797	  8,694</p>
<p>Per Share (based on average</p>
<p>of 3,977,481 shares in 1996</p>
<p>and 3,951,549 shares in 1995):</p>
<p>   Net Income					 2.71	   2.20</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk  (212) 859-1610</p>
</text>
